  "notes": "{掃|は}く is a transitive verb (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧) specifically for sweeping with a broom.\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{掃|は}いて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates sweeping is in progress.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- [place]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{掃|は}く — to sweep [place]\n- [debris]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{掃|は}く — to sweep up [debris]\n- ⟦{床|ゆか}→床：03652_yuka⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{掃|は}く (sweep the floor)\n- ⟦{庭|にわ}→庭：02239_niwa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{掃|は}く (sweep the garden)\n- {掃|は}き⟦{掃除|そうじ}→掃除：02889_souji⟧ (sweeping)\n- {掃|は}き{出|だ}し⟦{窓|まど}→窓：02254_mado⟧ (sliding glass door - opens to swept area)\n\nWATCH OUT:\n- {掃|は}く (to sweep) — different from:\n- ⟦{履|は}く→履く：00700_haku⟧ (to put on pants/shoes)\n- ⟦{吐|は}く→吐く：04397_haku⟧ (to vomit, exhale)\n\nAll three are read はく but have different kanji and meanings.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n⟦{箒|ほうき}→箒：03910_houki⟧ (broom)",
